---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/base-layout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="gptbash.com: privacy policy"
  description="Privacy policy for gptbash.com — information about data processing, cookies, and server logs."
  canonical="https://gptbash.com/privacy/"
>
  <div class="info-content">
    <h2>Privacy policy</h2>
    
    <p>
      gptbash.com collects and processes personal data to a minimal extent necessary
      for the proper functioning of the service.
    </p>

    <h3>Cookies</h3>
    <p>
      This service uses cookies for statistical purposes and to ensure some features work properly.
    </p>

    <h3>Google Analytics</h3>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics (Google LLC) to understand how the site is used (e.g. page views and basic
      interaction events). Google Analytics may set cookies on your device (for example, cookies such as
      <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code>) and process usage data to provide aggregated analytics reports.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can learn more about how Google uses cookies and data here:{' '}
      <a
        href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/cookies"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Google cookies policy
      </a>
      {' '}
      and{' '}
      <a
        href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Google privacy policy
      </a>
      .
    </p>
    <p>
      You can also opt out of Google Analytics using the official browser add-on:{' '}
      <a
        href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on
      </a>
      .
    </p>

    <h3>Personal data</h3>
    <p>
      We do not collect users’ personal data. Quotes submitted to the service are anonymous.
    </p>

    <h3>Server logs</h3>
    <p>
      The server automatically stores logs containing visitors’ IP addresses.
      This data is used solely for technical and statistical purposes.
    </p>

    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>
      For privacy-related matters, you can contact the site administrator.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .info-content {
    padding: 20px;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .info-content h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #444;
  }

  .info-content h3 {
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #555;
  }

  .info-content p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #555;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
</style>
